e":"2026-11-28T14:00:00Z","overview":"The Race continues through London, England, where the Express Pass is on the line, but several teams' hopes of a first-place finish are capsized while boating in a punt in Oxford.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race","released":"2026-11-28T14:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T14:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T15:00:00Z","overview":"The Race makes its first-ever visit to the Shetland Islands in Scotland, where teams must corral an unruly flock of sheep down a winding obstacle course.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race","released":"2026-11-28T15:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T16:00:00Z","overview":"When tasked with a painstaking Detour, the Dentists face the realization that they may need to use \"The Save.\" Meanwhile, one team's lack of communication leads to a massive meltdown on the mat.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race","released":"2026-11-28T16:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:00:00Z","overview":"With a double U-turn looming, emotions run high when two teams accuse each other of playing dirty.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race","released":"2026-11-28T17:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T17:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T18:00:00Z","overview":"Racers struggle on a frightening Road Block when they're suspended high above the Atlas Mountains.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race","released":"2026-11-28T18:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T18:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:00:00Z","overview":"THE AMAZING RACE takes off on its milestone 300th leg as teams race through Palermo, Sicily. Two rival teams form unlikely alliances and Racers battle to beat the clock in a high-octane go-cart race through the mountains.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race","released":"2026-11-28T19:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:00:00Z","overview":"For the first time in series history, the show travels to Valletta, Malta, where teams are thrown off balance when challenged to serve drinks to the knights of Malta. Also, a blind detour leaves Racers on a slippery slope.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race","released":"2026-11-28T20:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T21:00:00Z","overview":"One dangerous misstep leaves a Racer dangling 600 feet high in the Singapore sky, while a traditional Asian detox leaves several Teams writhing in pain.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race","released":"2026-11-28T21:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T21:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T22:00:00Z","overview":"Teams race to Manila, Philippines where they get muddy with an ornery Ox during a memorable switchback challenge from season five.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race","released":"2026-11-28T22:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T22:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T23:00:00Z","overview":"On the penultimate leg of the Race, two strong teams make a potentially one-million-dollar mistake. Also, Phil Keoghan greets the teams with shocking news at the Pit Stop.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race","released":"2026-11-28T23:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T23:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T00:00:00Z","overview":"For the first time ever, four teams battle it out in the final leg for the million-dollar prize, but one team will face a shocking elimination before making it to the finish line, on the season finale.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race","released":"2026-11-29T00:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T00:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T01:30:00Z","overview":"For the first time, THE AMAZING RACE features 11 new teams of all dating duos: six who are preexisting couples, and five duos who meet for the first time at the starting line.","genres":["Series","Reality","Competition Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race – Live","released":"2026-11-29T01:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T01:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race – Live","released":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race – Live","released":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race – Live","released":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T12:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race – Live","released":"2026-11-29T12:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T12:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T15:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race – Live","released":"2026-11-29T15:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T15:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T18:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race – Live","released":"2026-11-29T18:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T18:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T21:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_TheAmazingRace_us","title":"The Amazing Race – Live","re